348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (            It is a source of great pride to publish the fourth edition, which was entirely developed and created by journalism and mass communication students under the faculty supervision and with the encouragement of Honourable Vice-Chancellor Prof. G. Ravi and other University officials. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
349 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (    The month of April is especially fortunate for Alagappa University, which is commemorating the birth anniversary of its founder, Vallal Padmabhushan RM. Alagappa Chettiyar. He is a man of noble thoughts who has donated all of his earnings to the cause of education and student development. Many people contribute their wealth to education as an investment and for their heirs. But Vallal Padmabhushan RM. Alagappa Chettiyar did not spend his riches; instead, he donated his own residence to a college for the welfare of women in the early 1950s. The residents of Karaikudi, the employees of the Alagappa institutions, the students of the Alagappa institutions, and all of the community people in and around Karaikudi have always been grateful to him and paid respect and attention on his birth anniversary, April 6. Alagappa University takes the lead, led by the Honourable Vice-Chancellor Prof. G. Ravi, with all other institutions and the public to celebrate in a commemorative manner.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
350 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (     The Ithazhi magazine and its crew expressed tribute to Vallal Padmabhushan RM. Alagappa Chettiyar for allowing us to work at Alagappa University and sought the blessings of the noble soul.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (       The department had a great time and was happy to send its first-year students to Internship Training -1 at CNN, News Tamil 24x7, Vijay TV, Think Studio, India Glitz, Va Thamizha Va \(Direction Team\), Chennai, Aalayam FM, Coimbatore, and Sippy Television in Karaikudi. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (    The Ithazhi Magazine wishes second and first -year students and all other students to be successful in their term-end tests. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
