<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (           The 115th Birthday Anniversary of Vallal Alagappar who paved the way for the founding of Alagappa University was celebrated in a grand manner on 06.04.2024. The grand event started in the early morning with a rally taken out from Bhavanagar Stadium \(a favourite haunt of Dr. Alagappar\) to Vallal Alagappar Memorial Temple. The rally, led by Prof.G.Ravi Vice- Chancellor, included the Syndicate Members, Faculty Members, Officals of the University, Non-teaching Staff and Students. They paid floral tributes at the Memorial Temple)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
