457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The College of Education of Alagappa University arranged a two-day International Conference on Emerging Trends in Higher Education on March 14, 2024 at Convocation Seminar Hall. Dr. N. Arunachalam, Head of the Department, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication presented a Plenary Session on Media Literacy in Higher Education from 2.00 p.m. to 3.00 p.m. He conveyed a message on the importance of understanding and studying media in order express education content in a better way. He also explained how media literacy could be used effectively  in higher education for the benefit of the students. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
