465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On account of World Theatre Day, observed on March 27, The Department of Theatre and Film Studies conducted the Theatre Festival 2024 on March 26, 2024 at LCT.L Palaniappa Chettiar Memorial Auditorium. Prof. M. Sutha, Head of the Department, Department of Theatre and Film Studies welcomed the gathering. Prof. A. Senthilrajan, Registrar, Alagappa University, presented the presidential address. Mr. Anis, Film Director delivered the special address. Dr. M. Subbiah, Head of the Department, Department of Fine Arts and Performing Arts, Pondicherry Central University offered the felicitation address. Following that, the students of the department of Theatre and Film Studies enacted their theatre plays. 2nd year students of the department of Journalism and Mass Communication K. Ganesan, S. Jawhath Barhan, S. Seenivasan and S. Venkadesh acted in the plays. They mesmerized the audience through their acting skills. They received appreciation for their performance from the Film Director Anis, the Chief Guest of the Event. Director Anis and Dr. M. Subbiah, HOD, Department of Fine Arts and Performing Arts, Pondicherry Central University provided feedback to the students and offered them insights to improve their skills. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
