/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The first-year students of the Department of Journalism and Mass Communication conducted Farewell Party on April 03, 2024, to bid farewell to the second-year students who are leaving the university at the end of this academic year. Various events and games were organized to entertain and give them a memorable send-off to the outgoing students. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The department of History and Centre for Distance and Online Education conducted the valedictory function of 2nd International Conference on Inscriptions: The Primary Sources to Reconstruct History and Culture on March 29, 2024 at Convocation Hall, Alagappa University. Dr. K. Krishnamoorthy, Head of the department, Department of History welcomed the gathering. Dr. AR. Saravanakumar, Former Head of the Department, Department of History presented the conference report. Prof. A. Senthilrajan, Registrar, Alagappa University offered the presidential address. Prof. R. Ravanan, Joint Director in Finance, Directorate of Collegiate Education, Chennai, presented the Valedictory address. Dr. V. Venkataraman, Formerly Principal and Head Research Centre in History, Rajapalayam delivered the special address. Dr. N. Arunachalam, Head of the Department, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication offered the felicitation address. Dr. G. Paranthaman, Assistant professor, Department of History proposed the vote of thanks and concluded the event. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
