/ActualText (Later, that evening, at 5.00 p.m. the Opening Ceremony of Alumni Eco Park was organized. The Alumni Eco Park is opened at Pon Nagar. The student team from the department of Journalism and Mass Communication filmed the event and interviewed the alumni members who attended the event. )
