/ActualText (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication conducted an Alumni Meet on April 07, 2024 through online using Google Meet. The Alumni of the department participated in the event and shared their experience after graduation. They provided suggestions on how the course can be updated to meet the changing demands of the industry. The event was a memorable and virtual get together for the alumni of the department. )
