/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Virat Kohli's name will forever be etched in the history of Indian cricket. Born in Delhi in 1988, Kohli had an insatiable love for cricket from a young age. He trained intensively at the West Delhi Cricket Academy and excelled in youth cricket. He made his domestic debut for Delhi in 2006.)
/E (Virat Kohli's name will forever be etched in the history of Indian cricket. Born in Delhi in 1988, Kohli had an insatiable love for cricket from a young age. He trained intensively at the West Delhi Cricket Academy and excelled in youth cricket. He made his domestic debut for Delhi in 2006.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
602 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (2008 U-19 World Cup Win Kohli captained the Indian team that won the Under-19 World Cup in 2008.This success introduced his talent to the world stage. Kohli, who made his international debut in 2008, faced some struggles early on. But he overcame the challenges and attracted attention for his aggressiveness. Grand Records: Kohli has set various records like most centuries in ODIs, most runs in T20Is.He holds the distinction of being the only Indian player to have topped the charts in all three formats \(Test, ODI, T20\) till date.)
/E (2008 U-19 World Cup Win Kohli captained the Indian team that won the Under-19 World Cup in 2008.This success introduced his talent to the world stage. Kohli, who made his international debut in 2008, faced some struggles early on. But he overcame the challenges and attracted attention for his aggressiveness. Grand Records: Kohli has set various records like most centuries in ODIs, most runs in T20Is.He holds the distinction of being the only Indian player to have topped the charts in all three formats \(Test, ODI, T20\) till date.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The pinnacle of leadership \( peak of captaincy \) Kohli, who took over as the captain of the Indian team in 2014, took the team to new heights. Topping the Test rankings, he followed up his 2011 World Cup triumph and won the Champions Trophy.\(Aggressive\) leadership made him a threat to opponents. Current record \(current form\) Kohli is still in top form, playing for Team India and Royal Challengers Bangalore in the IPL. Virat Kohli is not only an achiever but also inspires the youth. His journey of hard work and self-belief is a guiding light for today's generation of cricketers.)
/E (The pinnacle of leadership \( peak of captaincy \) Kohli, who took over as the captain of the Indian team in 2014, took the team to new heights. Topping the Test rankings, he followed up his 2011 World Cup triumph and won the Champions Trophy.\(Aggressive\) leadership made him a threat to opponents. Current record \(current form\) Kohli is still in top form, playing for Team India and Royal Challengers Bangalore in the IPL. Virat Kohli is not only an achiever but also inspires the youth. His journey of hard work and self-belief is a guiding light for today's generation of cricketers.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Why do fans celebrate Virat Kohli even today?  Virat Kohli is still the heartbeat of Indian cricket fans. His achievements and attitude have made him very popular. Here are some reasons why fans should celebrate with him: A great cricketer. His aggressive game and ability to hit the ball all over the field mesmerizes the fans. \(Record Breaker\): Kohli has made various records like most centuries in ODIs, most runs in T20Is.These achievements make him one of the greatest Indian cricketers.)
/E (Why do fans celebrate Virat Kohli even today?  Virat Kohli is still the heartbeat of Indian cricket fans. His achievements and attitude have made him very popular. Here are some reasons why fans should celebrate with him: A great cricketer. His aggressive game and ability to hit the ball all over the field mesmerizes the fans. \(Record Breaker\): Kohli has made various records like most centuries in ODIs, most runs in T20Is.These achievements make him one of the greatest Indian cricketers.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (\(Dedication\): The Kholi's dedication to the game impresses the fans a lot. He gives inspiring motivation by showing that he is ready to bounce back by holding up the cricket bat despite failure. \(Leadership Qualities\): While captaining the Indian team, Kohli impressed everyone with his aggressive attitude and hunger for victory. Under his leadership, India won many series titles.)
/E (\(Dedication\): The Kholi's dedication to the game impresses the fans a lot. He gives inspiring motivation by showing that he is ready to bounce back by holding up the cricket bat despite failure. \(Leadership Qualities\): While captaining the Indian team, Kohli impressed everyone with his aggressive attitude and hunger for victory. Under his leadership, India won many series titles.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
