/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (\(Sportsman Spirit\): Fans love the way Kohli accepts not only victory but also defeat. Barratt's honest competitive nature \(Sportsman Spirit\) like dealing with opposing players with respect. His honest competitive spirit \(Sportsman Spirit\) like dealing with opposing players with respect is admirable. Due to these reasons and many more, Virat Kohli remains the Hero of Indian cricket fans even today. Here are some motivational quotes from Virat Kohli that can inspire youngsters: *"Focus on your strengths, not your weaknesses. Follow your own path, not someone else's." *" Failure doesn't mean the game is over, it means try again with experience." *"Never give up. Today's pain is tomorrow's strength.")
/E (\(Sportsman Spirit\): Fans love the way Kohli accepts not only victory but also defeat. Barratt's honest competitive nature \(Sportsman Spirit\) like dealing with opposing players with respect. His honest competitive spirit \(Sportsman Spirit\) like dealing with opposing players with respect is admirable. Due to these reasons and many more, Virat Kohli remains the Hero of Indian cricket fans even today. Here are some motivational quotes from Virat Kohli that can inspire youngsters: *"Focus on your strengths, not your weaknesses. Follow your own path, not someone else's." *" Failure doesn't mean the game is over, it means try again with experience." *"Never give up. Today's pain is tomorrow's strength.")
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
